 1 Overview  2 Limits  3 Usage  4 Backends  5 Config  6 Graphs  tui-node · v0.0.
Keys
  1 … 6       Overview, Limits, Usage, Backends, Config, Graphs; tab / → next, s
  r           reload the config file on the proxy (Overview, Config); reset the 
  v           validate the file on disk with check-config (Config)
  e           edit the file on disk: i insert, esc normal, ctrl+s save, ctrl+r s
  space       pause the graphs (Graphs)
  ↑ ↓ enter   select a rule and open its detail (Limits); hourly bars for a row 
  t           dry-run a request against the rules (Limits)
  /           filter the table (Limits, Usage)
  g s f x     cycle group-by, sort, edit the hour range, export CSV (Usage)
  ?           this help · q quit

Nothing here writes the config file except an explicit save in the editor, which
Polling every 2s; a STALE banner means the last poll failed and the screens show








? close help · q quit